      "title": "Confirmation Fee/Deposit",
      "description": "Confirmation Fee/Deposit | Culver-Stockton College Skip to content Pay Confirmation Fee (opens in new tab) Refer a Wildcat (opens in new tab) Request Info (opens in new tab) VISIT C-SC Apply (opens in new tab) Give (opens in new tab) MyCulver (opens in new tab) SEARCH What can we help you find? Search Academics Your Success Is Our Passion At Culver-Stockton College, our students come first. Our 14:1 student-to-faculty ratio means you’ll enjoy focused, individualized attention. We are committed to your success. Academic Programs Majors & Minors Graduate & Professional Studies Graduate Programs Online Undergraduate Programs CORE - Career Online Resources & Education Pre-Professional Programs Course Schedules Academic Catalog Inspired Learning Experiential Learning Innovation Alley Johnson-Turner IDEA Center Genomics Travel Study Moorman Professorship Program Tri-State Development Leadership - Konneker The Center for Rural Opportunity Center for Public Safety Opportunities Honors Catalyst Peer Tutoring 4-Year Guarantee First Year Experience Beyond the Classroom Resources Google AI for Education Student Success Registrar Commencement Accessibility & Accommodations Career & Internship Center Accreditation & Outcomes Library Order Textbooks Faculty & Staff Directory Admissions & Aid Rise to the Occasion, Begin Your Journey We’re excited that you are interested in the vibrant experiences and educational opportunities that Culver-Stockton College offers. We want you here. Information For: First Year Students Transfer and Re-Admit Students International Students Online Undergraduate Students Graduate Students Parents and Families Confirmation Fee/Deposit Accepted Students Cost & Financial Aid Cost & Financial Aid Academic Scholarships Additional Scholarships & Awards Federal & State Aid Private Loans Payment Options Organizational Discount Agreements Admission & Aid Resources Financial Aid Forms and Policies Outside Financial Aid Scholarships and Resources Net Price Calculator Financial Aid FAQs How to Choose a College AP Credit Registration Day Resources Viewbook Campus Life The Education You Need The Experiences You Want Affectionately known as “the Hill” to generations of students, you can expect to form lifelong friendships, enjoy transformational experiences and discover your passions. Welcome to “the Hill.” THINGS TO DO Student Organizations Intramurals Fraternity & Sorority Life Spiritual Life Wildcat Traditions Marching Band Student Produced Media AROUND THE HILL Dining Options Mabee Recreation & Wellness Center Residence Halls Campus Map Parking Map Exploring Beyond the Hill YOUR CONNECTIONS Counseling & Wellness Campus Safety Student Handbook Wildcat Warehouse Student Life Athletics Alumni Advancement About Transforming the Academic Experience Since 1853 The Wildcat community extends around the globe-united by more than 160 years of tradition, built on excellence in education. Our tradition grounds us. Your future inspires us. LEADERSHIP Office of the President Office of the Provost Board of Trustees Campus Leadership RECOGNITIONS Accreditation & Outcomes Third Party Rankings Highlights By the Numbers FAQ Disclosures About C-SC About Our History Canton Culver-Stockton College > Admission and Aid > Confirmation Fee/Deposit Confirmation Fee/Deposit Ready to make it Official? Easy ways to make your deposit... Make your deposit online by credit or debit card. Pay online here without any login information. Student ID required. please check credential email for ID or call the Admission Office. Log on your MyCulver Portal with your email address and portal password. Deposit By Phone Call the Business Office with your credit card information at 573-288-6000, ext. 6492 Deposit By Mail Mail $200 check payable to Culver-Stockton College to: Office of admission, One college hill, canton, mo 63435 Reserve your spot by submitting your $200 deposit. Submit your enrollment deposit now and take advantage of these early deposit benefits: Priority Housing : Once your deposit is received, we will send you instructions for completing your housing profile - keep in mind these will be processed first received, first served and usually occur in early spring. First choice of registration dates : Your paid deposit gives you to opportunity to familiarize yourself with the campus community by meeting staff, faculty and future classmates while setting your first class schedule which occurs in late spring. Early-bird class selection: When you choose your course schedule early, the stress of reserving your seat in the courses is gone! Most importantly, your enrollment deposit secures your spot on campus! You can rest easy and have confidence knowing where life will take you next -- Culver-Stockton College. *** Enrollment deposits are refundable until May 1 of each year by written request for those seeking Fall enrollment of that same year. Deposits for other terms are non-refundable. *** INFORMATION FOR Parents and Families Alumni & Friends Accessibility & Accommodations Employment MyCulver Transcript Requests Quick Links Directory Map & Directions Campus Safety Bookstore Wildcat Warehouse Calendar Library A-Z Index About C-SC Our History About Office of the President Campus Life By the Numbers In the News Contact Us Culver-Stockton College prepares students to Be Bold , Think Big , and Create Change through Experiential Learning, Innovation, and Community Engagement. 573-288-6000 admission@culver.edu One College Hill Canton, MO 63435 The mission of Culver-Stockton College is to prepare students of promise for a dynamic world through our distinctive experiential curriculum within a supportive learning community founded upon the best values of faith and the human spirit . © Copyright 2026 Culver-Stockton College, All rights reserved. WEBSITE ACCESSIBILITY | PRIVACY | SITEMAP"
    },
